  {
   "slug": "historical-designation-art-deco",
   "title": "Historical Designation - Art Deco",
   "paras": [
    "Sweeping scroll work transforms this historic residence’s pool into an elaborate underwater mosaic. Inspired by ornamental details in the original fireplace mantel, the composition carries the home’s decorative character into the water, with pale motifs set against a rich blue background.",
    "We manufactured and hand-cut the mosaic to fit the pool’s sloping floor and curved transitions beside the spa. Traditional wet-set installation allowed our artisans to adjust the artwork as it was placed, keeping the design continuous across the changing surfaces. The result is a custom aquatic centerpiece for this historic 1926residence."
   ],
   "imgs": [
