  {
   "slug": "modern-tuscan-cobalt-volute",
   "title": "Modern Tuscan - Cobalt Volute",
   "paras": [
    "Light scrollwork sweeps across a Deep Cobalt mosaic field, bringing movement and contrast to this custom pool. The rich blue glass from our Murano Series anchors a composition inspired by the residence’s Tuscan details, with each flourish scaled to its section of the pool floor.",
    "The palette was selected for the way it reads underwater, retaining the distinction between ornament and background beneath the reflected sky. The custom mosaic gives the pool an individual character through the combination of color, proportion and carefully placed detail."
   ],
