  {
   "slug": "old-world-greco-roman",
   "title": "Old World - Greco Roman",
   "paras": [
    "Classical geometry gives this waterfront pool a distinctly architectural finish. Repeating motifs and ornamental borders create a composed blue glass mosaic interior, while coordinated artwork in the circular spa carries the design beyond the main pool.",
    "Each element was developed for the pool’s proportions and the views from the surrounding residence. Mosaicist designed, manufactured and installed the composition, balancing the scale of the central motifs with the borders that frame them. Viewed from the terraces above, the pool and spa reveal the full arrangement of the underwater artwork."
   ],
